    "title": "myMDb",
    "description": "myMDb is a fresh take on an internet movie database built using the MERN web-development stack (MongoDB, Express.js, React, and Node.js) to provide a quick, responsive user experience. The site implements a media-centric design intended to be engaging and fun to use.\n\nYou can use myMDb to see what movies are at the theater, what shows are the most popular, and who's trending this week, along with many other things.\n\nCreating an account allows you to save your favorite movies, shows, and people for quick, convenient access.\n\nI taught myself React.js and started this project to solidify my understanding and get experience using React in a complete application. ",
